Mehta Traders ... Appellant
VERSUS
Sharma Enterprises ... Respondent
FACTS OF THE CASE:
1. Dishonour of cheque amounting to Rs 25 Lakhs under Section 138 of Negotiable Instruments Act, 1881.
ISSUES:
1. Presumption of legally enforceable debt under Section 139 of NI Act.

Page 2 of 2
REASONING & DECISION:
The statutory presumption under Section 139 stands unrebutted by the respondent.
RATIO DECIDENDI:
