Green Tamil Nadu Forum ... Petitioner
VERSUS
Tamil Nadu Pollution Control Board ... Respondent
FACTS OF THE CASE:
1. Illegal industrial effluent discharge into river basin.
ISSUES:
1. Application of Polluter Pays Principle and Precautionary Principle under Environment Protection Act, 1986.

Page 2 of 2
REASONING & DECISION:
State is trustee of natural resources under Public Trust Doctrine.
RATIO DECIDENDI:
