Commissioner of Income Tax ... Appellant
VERSUS
Reliance Retail Ltd ... Respondent
FACTS OF THE CASE:
1. Penalty under Section 271(1)(c) of Income Tax Act, 1961 for concealment of income.
ISSUES:
1. Disallowance of claim vs concealment of particulars.

Page 2 of 2
REASONING & DECISION:
Making a bona fide legal claim does not attract penalty for concealment.
RATIO DECIDENDI:
